; orchard_terraces.room - Terracos (design 04 section 3.6): stepped orchard terraces, earth tops on dry-stone walls; bench in the hollow at col 30.
; Entered from woods_canopy (floor hole cols 44-51) or by the drop from orchard_chasm_bridge (top cols 44-51, caught by the crown at row 4).
; Main path west climbs the crest (row 12) by the double jump; the counterweights shortcut lands on the west hill (row 9).

[room]
origin = 0, 0

